# OpenContainer package repo — build noise only; runtime blobs are committed.
# Root-anchored on purpose: vendored trees (vendor/npm-12.2.1/node_modules —
# npm's bundled deps) MUST stay tracked. A bare `node_modules` pattern
# silently dropped ~1,500 of npm's files from git once.
/node_modules/
/dist-types/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
*.log
.env*
kernel/native-core/target/
